        <mxCell id="note" value="Local development mirrors this path: Studio build → MUnit → run on local runtime, with Docker Compose providing Kafka + Kafka UI." style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=2;align=center;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
